## Non-negotiables

- Hand-written files ≤ **500 lines** (`node scripts/check_file_size.js`)
- BDD gate **81/161** scenarios mapped (`node e2e/scripts/check_bdd_coverage.js`)
- Node canonical; Dart mirrors HTTP when routes change
- Never raw exception text in prod 5xx bodies
- Calendar dates as `YYYY-MM-DD` on the wire

## Merge policy (summary)

- **Single domain / single agent:** PR direct to `main` when CI green.
- **Multi-agent sprint:** integration branch → one PR to `main`. See `merge-policy.mdc` + `/spawn-sprint-agents`.

## Cloud environment

PostgreSQL: `sudo pg_ctlcluster 16 main start` each session.  
Backend: `cd server && PGUSER=user PGPASSWORD=password PGHOST=localhost PGPORT=5432 PGDATABASE=agatha_db node bin/start.js`  
Full cloud caveats: `AGENTS.md`.

